Gateway restart semantics correction — 2026-09-08
Supersedes prior test expectations that dirty prevents all business startup.

Behavior:
- Valid dirty records permit startup. Durable operation barriers restore first.
- Ordinary unknown replies are not replayed and do not permanently block keys.
- Unknown execution state pauses NEW transitions, not ordinary Redis access.
- Pending operation keys remain protected; other keys serve normally after restart.
- Invalid/missing identity or operation state is not silently ignored.

